# database schema
# `db.sql` is a local scratch dump. `db.dev.sql` (the dev reference schema) and
# `/migrations` are TRACKED on purpose: the v1.4 prod deploy runs these files
# programmatically, DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md deep-links to them, and keeping them
# untracked is how a migration that could not apply to a fresh schema shipped
# unreviewed (see the 2026-08-07 notes in documentation/versions/v1.4/).
db.sql
